      "source": "Counts how many times the advisor chain passes through this advisor. Positioned\njust after <a href=\"../../../../chat/client/advisor/ToolCallingAdvisor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.chat.client.advisor\"><code>ToolCallingAdvisor</code></a> (order = DEFAULT_ORDER + 100), it is invoked\nonce per recursive tool-call iteration when the advisor manages the loop, and\nexactly once when the model handles tool calls internally.",
      "translation": "统计顾问链经过此顾问的次数。该顾问位于<a href=\"../../../../chat/client/advisor/ToolCallingAdvisor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.chat.client.advisor\"><code>ToolCallingAdvisor</code></a>之后（order = DEFAULT_ORDER + 100），当顾问管理循环时，每次递归工具调用迭代都会触发一次；而当模型内部处理工具调用时，则恰好触发一次。",
